{"reviewId": "25104340_81Hw9L0Af", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 18, "content": "近年来美国科技比如半导体、AI，尤其是英伟达等公司，让美国依旧领先。虽然都在唱美国走向衰落、乃至帝国黄昏抑或东升西落，但我们要有客观认识，只要美国科技遥遥领先，谈衰落或者有些早。现在美国又推出了稳定币，这是对美元的一种补充，还不知未来会如何。\n", "bookVersion": 0, "abstract": "包括石油美元长期萎缩、人民币去美元化以及负利率、高杠杆、高负债环境下美联储预期管理遭受的挑战。我们无法预测当前的美元体系何时走向消亡，", "range": "35396-35463", "reviewId": "25104340_81Hw9L0Af", "userVid": 25104340, "topics": [], "createTime": 1752714330, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 18, "chapterTitle": "13 康波体系下的黄金价格", "author": {"userVid": 25104340, "name": "大梦一方", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0022-rXmgPzBiewS~KCl2VzPZYab/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "见路不走", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-1000", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 1000}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 16, "likes": [{"userVid": 414458585, "name": "🌲", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0002-qHEk9NbwnipEQVkzI37JJ10/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-100", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 100}}], "commentsCount": 5, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "如果美国崩塌，所有国家受到的经济损伤不比美国少，一个长期占据主导地位，且供给它国的组织，相当于心脏，一荣俱荣，一损俱损。他会衰落，但只是不再那么强势。", "reviewId": "25104340_81Hw9L0Af", "commentId": "25104340_81Hw9L0Af_c424412937_8934s99yB", "userVid": 424412937, "createTime": 1778589858, "likesCount": 3, "isLik